Feature: Deliveries

    @rule
    Rule: A parcel is delivered to its address
        Only to the address on its label.

        Background:
            Given a courier C-7 on route R-12

        Example: At the door
            Given a parcel PX-1 for Grimmaische Strasse 1
            When C-7 delivers PX-1
            Then PX-1 is DELIVERED

        @neighbour
        Example: To a neighbour
            Given a parcel PX-2 for Grimmaische Strasse 2
            When C-7 delivers PX-2 to the neighbour
            Then PX-2 is DELIVERED_TO_NEIGHBOUR

    Rule: A parcel nobody takes goes back to the depot

        Scenario: Nobody home
            Given a parcel PX-3 for Grimmaische Strasse 3
            When C-7 finds nobody home
            Then PX-3 is RETURNING
